  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAIF contribution to the project &apos;Carretera F-21 Tramo Uyuni -Tupiza&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project consists of the construction/update of a 188.3 km single carriageway road between Uyuni and Tupiza in southern Bolivia. The road is known as Ruta F-21 and is part of corridor Integraci&#xf3;n Central, which connects with neighbouring countries.</narrative>
  </description>
